mapping "M069X.1" source="M069X" target="69896004" relationship=equivalent effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.87 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source M069X SNOMED CT 69896004 = RA unspecified with other/unspecified localization. Target SNOMED CT
        80809 (69896004), the general RA disorder concept. The Swedish X-suffix bucket for the M06.9
        family is semantically equivalent to general RA without site qualification; the ICD10 M06.9 base
        code maps to 80809 via Athena. high: the general SNOMED CT concept is the correct standard target;
        the qualifier does not change the clinical entity.
        """
}
mapping "M073B.1" source="M073B" target="156370009" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target effect=omitted quality=60 {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source M073B SNOMED CT 156370009 = psoriatic arthritis of shoulder. Target SNOMED CT 40319772
        (156370009), the general concept. No site-specific psoriatic-arthritis SNOMED CT concept exists in
        the standard vocabulary (verified in the SNOMED CT mirror). The target fully subsumes the source
        (every PA of shoulder is PA), so this is a one-level broader map. moderate: site specificity is
        lost; the broader target is the best available standard concept.
        """
}
